00:20:46,861 --> 00:20:51,480
the Allies to victory. After the war, gasoline helped

355
00:20:51,481 --> 00:20:56,380
ignite a post-war consumer boom. And it was clear that Americans

356
00:20:56,381 --> 00:20:59,660
were going to need a lot of gasoline to fuel this lavish new

357
00:20:59,661 --> 00:21:04,420
lifestyle. Next, making sense of the maze

