359
00:21:10,021 --> 00:21:13,300
The first gas pumps had no displays at all.

360
00:21:13,301 --> 00:21:16,120
Customers in the early 1900s had to simply trust

361
00:21:16,121 --> 00:21:17,600
that the attendant was charging them

362
00:21:17,601 --> 00:21:18,780
for the right amount of fuel.

363
00:21:23,700 --> 00:21:26,820
From a distance, gasoline-producing refineries

364
00:21:26,821 --> 00:21:29,140
