386
00:22:29,241 --> 00:22:32,500
to lower the boiling point of the materials, which lowers

387
00:22:32,501 --> 00:22:35,240
their big heating bills.

388
00:22:35,241 --> 00:22:39,740
of 700 degrees, temperatures of 400 to 500 degrees Fahrenheit

389
00:22:39,741 --> 00:22:41,240
now do the trick.

390
00:22:41,241 --> 00:22:44,040
Like those of early refineries, the fractionating towers

391
00:22:44,041 --> 00:22:49,740
