00:26:41,681 --> 00:26:47,160
But due to computerization, only about 600 people per shift are needed today.

462
00:26:47,161 --> 00:26:52,580
The sophisticated units that produce millions of gallons of gasoline every day can be

463
00:26:52,581 --> 00:26:55,640
