464
00:26:55,641 --> 00:26:58,820
Other workers use bicycles, golf carts, and trucks to move

465
00:26:58,821 --> 00:27:01,820
around and perform all of the tough work.

466
00:27:01,821 --> 00:27:05,820
Out here, safety is the number one priority.

467
00:27:05,821 --> 00:27:08,220
You were growing up in the refining country.

468
00:27:08,221 --> 00:27:11,340
It was not uncommon to have classmates whose dad had been

