00:27:48,541 --> 00:27:54,980
At the dawn of the 20th century, horse-drawn wagons with wooden containers transported gasoline from refineries.

481
00:27:56,380 --> 00:28:00,700
They delivered fuel to general stores, where it was sold by the bucket.

482
00:28:01,180 --> 00:28:03,820
You brought it back to your house and filled up your car.

