They tried a delivery system where they had wagons deliver the gasoline to your house,

484
00:28:08,901 --> 00:28:14,080
but they found they blew up too often, and it was too dangerous a way to distribute gasoline.

485
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:18,460
To reduce gasoline's exposure to sparks and flames out in the open,

486
00:28:18,540 --> 00:28:21,000
especially near people's homes,

487
00:28:21,880 --> 00:28:24,180
Sylvanus Bowser of Fort Wayne, Indiana,

488
00:28:24,740 --> 00:28:27,860
adapted his oil pump for gasoline use in 1905.

